# Teacher accounts. Copy to bot/users.txt, edit, then:
#
#     python bot/scripts/set_users.py
#
# This file IS the account list. The script makes the database match it
# exactly: names removed here are deleted there, and every password is set
# from what is written here. There is no signup, no reset email and no
# password anyone but you chooses -- the cohort is small enough that a text
# file is the whole system.
#
# One account per line, columns separated by spaces:
#
#     username    password    full name (optional, may contain spaces)
#
# Usernames and passwords cannot contain spaces. Passwords need at least 12
# characters. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# bot/users.txt holds plaintext passwords and is gitignored. Keep it where you
# keep the rest of your secrets, not in this repository's history.

dieter      choose-a-real-one      Dieter Vanderelst
